@startuml
title Diagrama de Secuencia - POST /api/citas

actor "500 Pacientes" as Paciente
participant "API Node.js" as API
participant "Prometheus" as Prom
participant "Grafana" as Graf

== Solicitud Individual ==

Paciente -> API: POST /api/citas
note right of API: Validacion y latencia (0-50ms)
API --> Paciente: 201 Created (cita JSON)

== Prueba de Carga (500 concurrentes) ==

Paciente -> API: 500 peticiones simultaneas
note right of API: avg=25.6ms p95=48.1ms max=96.4ms

API -> Prom: /metrics (histogramas)
Prom --> Graf: T95=48ms < 200ms
note right of Graf: CUMPLE SLA

@enduml
